  "transport_scope": "The11 supervised rows and separate unchanged tuning row are bound by exact membership/PlanId/contract_sha only. This primary grants no supervised semantic approval. Tuning remains its separate existing128trial seed1729 TPE/ASHA/MedianPruner target with max1000updates/trial; no five-seed tuning cohort is invented.",
  "independent_reasoning": [
    "I read the current native policy/evaluator/prepared-state/assessment/serving/Store consumers and current App lifecycle/status delta, independently reread the603 source files and115 provider rows, recomputed exact full55 hashes, parsed all38 current target/slack declarations and rebuilt all native schedule/reference/WDL arithmetic. Current60 native providers equal historical4f bytes and actual Apple55 equals historical membership; these are corroborating inputs, not substituted acceptance.",
    "Strict own-effective-initial gain is the source-independent reason the proposed criterion measures an attained change in the actual scheduled learner. Every named fixed/simple reference adds a distinct finite alternative explanation that must be overcome in the same member. Their conjunction is stricter than either separate statement and does not infer learning merely from a legacy quality floor.",
    "At least three of the same five complete originals must satisfy joint learning. Full-five unchanged quality medians are separate mandatory gates and do not select or censor members. Served index0 must independently satisfy its own learning, all old quality and positive-update/curve/evidence/physical-serving requirements. No claim that the three joint successes are three individually quality-passing seeds is made.",
    "A reference tie below a proved exact maximum would not demonstrate superiority to that baseline and is rejected. At an actually attained global endpoint, strict superiority is mathematically impossible; equality at that proved endpoint is justified only while strict own-initial gain and all other restrictions persist. RETURN supports only actual current full-state/time KeyDoor proof; HER supports20success/0distance endpoints. Arena9/9 follows structurally from all nine keyed WDL outcomes, and Connect4/Hex/Gomoku neutral reference ties require actual attained9/9 evidence. Othello comparison stays strict without such actual attainment.",
    "The20 reset cases, fixed HER goals and9 addressed games are a finite pinned benchmark. Repeated reset states or duplicate goals are not independent environments. Native3of5 is a robustness restriction, with no population confidence/FPR/IID bound imported from supervised binomial reasoning.",
    "Existing target/slack values and bounded native recipes remain project restrictions. This review neither calibrates them with new outcomes nor turns unproved project slacks into published benchmark means. A demanding criterion may fail actual training; acceptance does not promise feasibility or justify a replacement seed, larger budget, changed recipe or easier floor."
  ],
