    "references": "all constant actions for unmasked discrete tasks; all6!720 fixed legal-mask preferences on KeyDoor; native zero/lower/upper endpoints for continuous; only actual current complete KeyDoor ceiling authorizes its endpoint reference equality",
    "separate_quality": "whole-five original Double median passes the unchanged per-row floor; served0 own final metric passes the same floor"
  },
  "HER_criteria": {
