    "joint_learning": "Both strict final-success>own-initial-success AND exact final-mean-distance<own-initial-distance, and both exhaustive-reference dimensions, all in the SAME member; references tied only at actual20/20 success and exact0 distance. Never waive initial gains.",
    "unchanged_quality": "Double success >=0.90-0.05 and distance <=0.05, each whole-five median plus served0 own both. Decimal17/20 is exposition of the source success subtraction, not replacement arithmetic.",
    "rationale": "Success and distance are complementary: progress on only one cannot satisfy the joint condition. The full46656 goal-blind sequence family is finite and exact, with all20 outcomes/extrema/attainers retained and replayed; duplicates do not become independent goals. Endpoint equality is the only attainable response when a reference already reaches global success20 or distance0. A final policy still must strictly improve over its actual own initial values."
  },
